{
	"info": {
		"name": "BuildWeek Back-End 3 - Users",
		"description": "Auth + Users CRUD.\n\nFlujo sugerido:\n1. Auth > Register admin\n2. Auth > Register user\n3. Auth > Register temp (para borrar)\n4. Auth > Login admin  (guarda {{accessToken}} automaticamente)\n5. Users > cualquier request (usa el Bearer token de la coleccion)\n\nVariables de coleccion:\n- baseUrl: http://localhost:2462\n- accessToken: lo setea el login\n- userId: id para probar GET/PUT/PATCH por id\n- tempUserId: id del usuario temp, para el DELETE",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
	},
	"auth": {
		"type": "bearer",
		"bearer": [
			{
				"key": "token",
				"value": "{{accessToken}}",
				"type": "string"
			}
		]
	},
	"variable": [
		{
			"key": "baseUrl",
			"value": "http://localhost:2462"
		},
		{
			"key": "accessToken",
			"value": ""
		},
		{
			"key": "userId",
			"value": "1"
		},
		{
			"key": "tempUserId",
			"value": "3"
		}
	],
	"item": [
		{
			"name": "Auth",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "Register - admin",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"type": "text/javascript",
								"exec": [
									"if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
									"    var json = pm.response.json();",
									"    pm.collectionVariables.set(\"adminUserId\", json.userId);",
									"    pm.collectionVariables.set(\"userId\", json.userId);",
									"}"
								]
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"auth": {
							"type": "noauth"
						},
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Content-Type",
								"value": "application/json"
							}
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Mario\",\n  \"surname\": \"Rossi\",\n  \"email\": \"admin@test.com\",\n  \"password\": \"admin123\"\n}"
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register",
							"host": [
								"{{baseUrl}}"
							],
							"path": [
								"api",
								"auth",
								"register"
							]
						},
						"description": "Crea el usuario. Responde 201 { \"userId\": N }. El rol por defecto es USER; para hacerlo ADMIN usa luego Users > Assign role."
					}
				},
				{
					"name": "Register - user",
